{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Powwow Bound: A Menominee Homecoming </i>is a 3D narrative-driven adventure game. Experience the story of a Menominee family returning to the reservation for the annual contest powwow. Play as Deborah Jo (DJ) as she works to uncover her mom\u2019s history with the powwow dance circle through narrative set pieces and Powwow-inspired minigames. Learn about traditional dance styles through a rhythm game and take photos of recreated locations set on the Menominee Reservation in Wisconsin.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Amateur Photographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/914cdf96e66e4c3ffb5831e91faa3c25b38ef1ea.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Photographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/151cc392dfc613dc8008fcb7e5106d84603348c1.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Photographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/bd6f5bc440b10376132bc7dd29bb354b52d0706a.jpg"},{"name":"Photo Fanatic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/741ee07ae2fede8e42f51e7730bddeedbd91373c.jpg"},{"name":"Uncle Puns: Corn-ivore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/1b9e29bc9ef44836dc2aa10ed711f1c93f0f1710.jpg"},{"name":"Uncle Puns: Children of the Corn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/47318446961304d2371817f5451ac92ef13f57cd.jpg"},{"name":"Uncle Puns: Pop in","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/710b827d68193023cfe349a84b1e28961ecf9126.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Jokes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778870/3bbd1cb2db91eb6833e47187ef584421fb6abf59.jpg"},{"name":"Net\u0101\u0113newaem\u0101kanak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/37